            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Yes, for the problem it is designed to solve: moisture migrating through porous masonry, which shows up as damp walls, a musty smell and efflorescence. Applied in two full coats to bare, properly prepared masonry it reliably stops that seepage for years. It does not solve water arriving under pressure from failed drainage, and the overwhelming majority of complaints about it trace back to preparation rather than the product.",
