          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">DRYLOK works</strong>, on bare masonry, in two coats, against seepage and damp rather than against drainage failure. The 15 psi rating on the Extreme formula is real, the 15-year warranty is real, and so is the requirement that the wall underneath be stripped, brushed clean and dry before you start.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            Judge your wall honestly first. Damp, musty and blooming white is DRYLOK's problem to solve. Cracking seasonally, permanently damp, or wet after every storm is not — and reaching for a tin in those cases is how a good product ends up with a bad reputation.
